- !<Text/d1ade5ee-a5ab-422f-8ce2-95c71e237cdd>
  PrefabRemaps:
    []
  Name: Text
  Enabled: true
  RenderOrder: 11
  StretchMode: Stretch
  VerticalAlignment: Center
  HorizontalAlignment: Left
  MeshShadowMode: None
  ShadowColor: {x: 1.000000, y: 1.000000, z: 1.000000, w: 1.000000}
  ShadowDensity: 1.000000
  Text: |-
    Midi turns notes from a MIDI instrument into events your Lens can react to. In this demo a built-in mock instrument plays a drum pattern, so no keyboard is needed: the pads flash on every note, and the tempo and last note update live.
    
    Pinch Ok to begin, then use Start and Stop on the panel.
